      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Let tempvol = sum of monthly share trading volume (vol) over the previous three months, scaled by 3 times common shares outstanding (shrout). Let ShareVol = 1 if tempvol > 10%, and ShareVol = 0 if tempvol < 5%. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=未写；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=-1.0；TestInOP=univariate reg。股票池/过滤：exchcd==1。 Notes：OP does a linear regression, but the variable is extremely right skewed, with a mean around 5, stdev of 18, and median of 2. To approximate a regression in our setup, we long / short depending on the signal's value rather than ranking.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
